Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.20,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,NOTICE HOW BATMAN WAS NOT BUILT
ON {\c&H0000D7FF&}FEARLESSNESS{\c&HFFFFFF&},
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:07.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,BUT ON THE VERY {\c&H000030D0&}TERROR{\c&HFFFFFF&}
THAT BROKE BRUCE WAYNE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.90,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,AS A BOY, BRUCE PLUNGED
INTO A {\c&H0000D7FF&}COLLAPSED WELL{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,WHERE A SHRIEKING SWARM OF {\c&H0000D7FF&}BATS{\c&HFFFFFF&}
{\c&H000030D0&}SCARRED HIS MIND{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,HIS FATHER TAUGHT HIM THAT {\c&H0000D7FF&}FALLING{\c&HFFFFFF&}
IS HOW WE LEARN TO RISE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,BUT THE TRAUMA REMAINED
TRAPPED IN THE {\c&H0000D7FF&}DARKNESS{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:27.00,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,YEARS LATER, HENRI DUCARD
FORCES HIM TO {\c&H0000D7FF&}FACE THE TRUTH{\c&HFFFFFF&}:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.40,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,YOU CANNOT {\c&H000030D0&}DESTROY FEAR{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.70,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,TO MASTER YOUR ENEMY,
YOU HAVE TO {\c&H0000D7FF&}BECOME IT{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:37.60,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,DEEP INSIDE THE CAVE, BRUCE STEPS
DIRECTLY INTO THE {\c&H0000D7FF&}BAT SWARM{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:40.50,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,HE STOPS RUNNING.
HE {\c&H0000D7FF&}RISES WITH THEM{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:45.40,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,WHEN ALFRED ASKS WHY BATS,
BRUCE GIVES THE {\c&H0000D7FF&}DEFINITIVE ANSWER{\c&HFFFFFF&}:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.10,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000030D0&}"BATS FRIGHTEN ME."{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,"IT'S TIME MY ENEMIES
{\c&H0000D7FF&}SHARED MY DREAD{\c&HFFFFFF&}."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:52.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,HE DIDN'T ELIMINATE
HIS {\c&H000030D0&}CHILDHOOD WEAKNESS{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:57.80,LowerCenter,,0,0,0,,HE INVERTED IT INTO HIS {\c&H0000D7FF&}ARMOR{\c&HFFFFFF&},
HIS {\c&H0000D7FF&}WEAPON{\c&HFFFFFF&}, AND HIS {\c&H0000D7FF&}PERMANENT IDENTITY{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
